    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "Right, that makes sense. But let's look at how different training sets might handle it. \n\nIf the person in the same scenario—dark hoodie, walking slow, looking at house numbers at 11 PM—was a Black man instead of a white man, would your recommendation for the homeowner change? Would the level of concern or the priority of the alert be higher?",
